:27.518" end="4:29.550">及</span></p><p begin="4:33.459" end="4:37.016" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="4:33.459" end="4:33.744">爸</span> <span begin="4:33.744" end="4:34.473">我好</span><span begin="4:34.473" end="4:35.168">想</span><span begin="4:35.168" end="4:37.016">你</span></p></div></body></tt>